与你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6108.79, "timestamp": "01:41:48", "text": "身份相符，也没有任何会破坏沉浸感的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6111.189, "timestamp": "01:41:51", "text": "事情，你也没有任何纹身，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6113.75, "timestamp": "01:41:53", "text": "如果你是唯一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6115.59, "timestamp": "01:41:55", "text": "一个最终没有露出双手的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6118.47, "timestamp": "01:41:58", "text": "而其他人却露出了双手，那仍然会很奇怪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6119.91, "timestamp": "01:41:59", "text": "你知道吗？   是的"}]